  "instructions": [
    "Heat the oil in a large pot over medium heat.",
    "Add the onion and bell pepper and cook until the vegetables are tender.",
    "Add the garlic and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add the curry powder and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add the coconut milk and bring the mixture to a simmer.",
    "Add the paneer and cook until the cheese is coated in the curry sauce.",
    "Reduce the heat to low and cook for 20 minutes.",
    "Stir in the thyme and season with salt and pepper to taste.",
    "Serve the curry hot over rice or with naan bread."
